From 853ca6800677964cf67303bdcb9076432a34fb49 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: x <x@x.x>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 15:44:32 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Anthropic Messages API on the Spark and CUDA servers

Port TensorFold v0.6.3's Anthropic Messages API (server/anthropic.py,
server/anthropic_translate.py, server/request_body.py; the request-framing
helpers) onto the v0.6.0 tree this project pins, so the built image answers
/v1/messages and /v1/messages/count_tokens on the DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash Spark
server too.

Wiring: the anthropic route on the Spark, CUDA and generic HTTP handlers;
matched_stop + reply stop_sequence; the DeepSeek app's prepare() hook for
count_tokens; the Spark server emits stop_sequence. Tests and docs included.
